{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a08b8666a7e517e0","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# TrustyAI\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: TrustyAI\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA); lm-eval integration Tech Preview\n5\t**Owning team**: TrustyAI\n6\t**Upstream**: trustyai-explainability/trustyai-service-operator\n7\t**Midstream**: red-hat-data-services/trustyai-service-operator\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tModel quality and trustworthiness services: fairness/bias metrics, drift\n13\tdetection, explainability, and guardrails. Ships an operator that manages\n14\tTrustyAIService instances per data science project. The lm-eval job runner\n15\t(LMEvalJob CRD, wrapping EleutherAI lm-evaluation-harness) is Tech Preview and\n16\tis the platform's existing entry point for LLM benchmark execution.\n17\t\n18\t## Dependencies\n19\t\n20\t- KServe/ModelMesh inference endpoints as metric data sources\n21\t- Kubernetes Jobs for lm-eval benchmark execution\n22\t\n23\t## Interfaces\n24\t\n25\t- TrustyAIService and LMEvalJob CRDs (trustyai.opendatahub.io)\n26\t- REST metrics API consumed by the Dashboard\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac5b4ff9c303f917","agent_id":"ae45dea40064cd644","session_id":"45850d2e-0f91-4d60-8339-ec068a16e17f","uuid":"80f6235e-8e41-44e8-8e19-53139be6632a","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:18:05.928Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a08b8666a7e517e0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9014"}
