eature development beyond GA-bar quality work\n41\t- Deprecating alternative GenAI serving paths\n42\t\n43\t## Open Questions\n44\t\n45\t1. The GA scope itself depends on HLR-1's assessment — until it lands, the\n46\t   size of the stability and hardening work is an estimate.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8385305d62eab0a5","agent_id":"aadbfefa472cec417","session_id":"45850d2e-0f91-4d60-8339-ec068a16e17f","uuid":"65d2ad81-7988-4c3d-a0f6-0d4ba20b3967","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:24:17.254Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9aeff5aa4d303711","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
