eature development beyond GA-bar quality work\n41\t- Deprecating alternative GenAI serving paths\n42\t\n43\t## Open Questions\n44\t\n45\t1. The GA scope itself depends on HLR-1's assessment — until it lands, the\n46\t   size of the stability and hardening work is an estimate.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-88c364c239ded659","agent_id":"a6dbd5aac7cb52e6f","session_id":"45850d2e-0f91-4d60-8339-ec068a16e17f","uuid":"b01cc476-9f28-49f6-a835-84fd980d0922","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:28:27.610Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e9921698f1de091","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
